flowchart TD
    GW[Hermes gateway] -->|loads manifest + calls register| REG[dyvine_hermes.plugin register]
    REG -->|all TOOL_SPECS + 1 skill| TOOLSET[dyvine toolset]
    TOOLSET -->|args dict| WRAP[as_tool_handler: serialize to JSON string]
    WRAP --> RAW[raw handler: one service call]
    RAW -->|first call boots| ENG[get_engine: one Engine per process]
    ENG --> SVC[services: users / posts / livestreams / queue / profiles / delivery]
    ENG --> REPO[Postgres repositories]
    SVC --> F2[f2 Douyin SDK]
    SVC --> R2[Cloudflare R2]
    SVC --> REPO[(Postgres: operations, queue, seeds, send_status, profiles, rounds, watch)]
    SVC --> FS[Feishu open platform]

